      "id": "s3-line1",
      "type": "line-breakdown",
      "label": "가사 읽기",
      "lyricLine": "지났지만",
      "breakdown": "지나다 = to pass / to go by\n지났 = past tense stem\n지만 = but / although\n\n\"It passed, but...\" or \"Although it's passed...\"\n\n**-지만** connects two contrasting ideas. The moment passed, BUT the feelings remain.",
      "dictionary": [
        {
          "word": "지나다",
          "reading": "지나다",
          "meaning": "to pass / to go by"
        },
        {
          "word": "-지만",
          "reading": "-지만",
          "meaning": "but / although (contrast connector)"
        }
      ]
    },
